From: XR1710G local integration
Subject: [PATCH] mt7996: adapt YYH txpower refresh and SKU/backoff handling

Reference: https://github.com/YYH2913/openwrt
Commit: 9e44788d769164dc9f691670add71dc466d99a4c
Original author: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
Reference patches: 0006 and 0007 (2026-06-24).

Preserve the current thermal/ADC header additions. Keep strict rejection
of unsupported TXPOWER controls; unwind radio enable on new run failure.
Balance node references in the new power-path lookup helpers and assert
417-byte rate / 494-byte backoff ABI layouts at compile time.
The current board has no OF power-limits table: preserve conditional
backoff enable instead of enabling an empty table. No EEPROM writes.
Hardware and bidirectional throughput validation remain pending.

